{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>They shall not make a baldness on their head.</b> For the dead." "<b>And the edge of their beard.</b> For the dead, according to the custom of the lands of the Chaldeans. And so the meaning of \"the edge of your beard\" is clarified." "And the meaning of <b>cutting</b> is even a single one. And Israel has already been warned concerning these. And the reason He warned them is that a bald head and a shaven beard and cut flesh are not fit to serve before HaShem."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:30.278750743Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}